  "combustion_or_fuel_configuration_text": "7F gas turbines",
  "hardware_or_part_configuration_text": "Applies to affected S3S part numbers listed in Table 1 and S3Bs that have operated with affected (uncooled) S3Ss per Table 1. Recommendations apply regardless of which AGP configuration (e.g., Standard, Tech, Tech-Lite, etc.) is installed in a unit or that unit's hours/starts duty cycle. After installation of modified S3Ss, resizing of ninth-stage extraction air orifice plate, unit control constant update, and installation of updated inter-segment seals (laminate seals) on specified static components are required; a CM&U process is mandatory to implement these changes.",
