      "field": "service_recommendation_line_items",
      "snippet": "After installation of the modified S3Ss, the following configuration changes are needed to account for the addition of the S3S cooling air: 1.Resizing of ninth-stage extraction air orifice plate 2. Unit control constant update 3. Installation of updated inter-segment seals, i.e., laminate seals, on the following static components."
