      "context": "Stator keys: recommended to order in advance because uninstalling stator segments may require key replacement.",
      "required_inspection_types": [],
      "source_location": "RECOMMENDATIONS (planned/unplanned outages when CDC exposed) and SCOPE OF WORK notes"
    },
    {
