  "hardware_or_part_configuration_text": "Retention keys in the upper-half (UH) compressor-section casings retain stator vane segments, seals (high-pressure packing seal (HPPS) and aft inducer seal (AIS)), inducer, and casing treatment (CT) ring. AIS is installed only on HA.0x units. Inducer is installed only on HA.0x units with a double-wall compressor discharge casing. CT ring is installed only on 7HA.03 units.",
